                    },
                    "message": "Not required as the same logic is used throughout the code to configure, modify, delete the IPv6 addresses, IPv6 static default gateways.\nAs explained if the address list is [a,b,c,d]\nTo delete c and retain the others the patch list needs to be [{},{},${null},{}]"
